<?xml version="1.0"?>
<AlteryxDocument yxmdVer="2024.1">
  <Nodes>
    <Node ToolID="1392">
      <GuiSettings Plugin="AlteryxGuiToolkit.TextBox.TextBox">
        <Position x="68" y="393" width="552" height="444" />
      </GuiSettings>
      <Properties>
        <Configuration>
          <Text><![CDATA[OVERVIEW

This workflow is the backbone of all Salesforce reporting.  Multiple tables and transformation outputs tables to SQL Server SF_Datasources.

Salesforce tables are pulled via DBAmp and raw tables are output to -> odbc:DRIVER={SQL Server};DATABASE=salesforce backups;SERVER=NUSCLEVPDBAMP02;Trusted_Connection=yes

There are 2 schedules for the DBAmp job...
1.  "Daily" job (full table copy) run Weekly on Mon, Tues, Wed, Thur, Fri, Sat, Sun @8:30 PM
2.  "Intraday" job (short list of tables) run every 2 hours between 7:00 A and 7:00 P Mon through Fri.  The tables in this workflow are in this job.  

This workflow runs on the following schedule:  Every other hour, on the even hours (opposite from DBAmp schedule) Monday - Sunday.  ]]></Text>
          <Font name="Arial" size="12" style="1" />
          <TextColor name="White" />
          <FillColor r="0" g="64" b="128" />
          <Shape shape="0" />
          <Justification Justification="4" />
        </Configuration>
        <Annotation DisplayMode="0">
          <Name />
          <DefaultAnnotationText />
          <Left value="False" />
        </Annotation>
      </Properties>
    </Node>
