      <Properties>
        <Configuration>
          <Text><![CDATA[COMMAND/EVENTS Tab
(Workflow configuration)

Ran after the finishing of the workflow.

1.  Email sent for any errors encountered in the workflow.

2.  Tab command
\\lealteryx.na.corp.le\data\SF_Data\Tableau\tabcmd\TabCmd_SF_SQL_OPPORTUNITY_PRODUCTS-REL.bat
\\lealteryx.na.corp.le\data\SF_Data\Tableau\tabcmd\TabCmd_SF_SQL_OPPORTUNITY_PRODUCTS-US.bat
\\lealteryx.na.corp.le\data\SF_Data\Tableau\tabcmd\TabCmd_SF_SQL_OPPORTUNITY_SUMMARY.bat

Tab Command Arguments:     tabcmd.exe

Working Command:     \\lealteryx.na.corp.le\data\SF_Data\Tableau\tabcmd

This is run at the end of the workflow to avoid partial data being pulled into the Tableau views through scheduling differences.  ]]></Text>
